Package: gettoken-exchanger
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}@DEPENDS@:gettoken-exchanger
Description: token broker for AI agents - trades a super-token for a narrow one
 The exchanger is asked for a capability. It finds the plugin installed for
 the service named by the capability's first segment, reads the super-token
 the store holds for that service, hands it to the plugin, and answers with
 the narrow token the plugin writes back.
 .
 It ships no plugin. Each integrated tool installs its own into
 /usr/lib/gettoken/exchangers, so adding the hundredth tool costs what the
 first one did.
